{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45929","headline":"送卢舍人朝觐 · 贯休","name":"送卢舍人朝觐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羶行无爲日，垂衣帝道亨。\n圣真千载圣，明必万年明。\n重德须朝觐，流年不可轻。\n洪才传出世，清甲得高名。\n罕玉藏无映，嵇松画不成。\n起衔轩后勅，醉别亚夫营。\n烧阔荆州熟，霞新岘首晴。\n重重尧雨露，去去汉公卿。\n白发应从白，清贫但更清。\n梦缘丹陛险，春傍彩衣生。\n既握锺繇笔，须调傅说羹。\n倘因星使出，一望问支铿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}